---
SPECIFICATION SUMMARY
---

Edge: Microstructure mean-reversion (1h z-score fade)
Granularity: 1h (1H = 1-hour candles)
Parameters (all hardcoded, no grid search):
  K (lookback): 3 bars
  W (volatility window): 168 bars (7 days, t-1 only)
  Z_enter (entry threshold): 2.0 (|z| > 2.0)
  Position: fade (SHORT if z>+2.0, LONG if z<-2.0)
  N (holding period): 3 bars (time-exit only)
  Non-overlapping: yes (entry+N period locked, no new entries)

Cost Model:
  Notional: $50,000 (equal gross margin)
  S-taker (main gate): BTC 12.03bps / ETH 12.69bps per round-trip
  S-maker (reference): BTC 8.02bps / ETH 8.34bps per round-trip (50% fill assumption)
  $100k sensitivity: BTC 12.13bps / ETH 13.06bps (reference)
  Funding: excluded (3-hour holding < 8-hour settlement interval)

Periods:
  Selection (in-sample): 2019-08-10 ~ 2021-12-31 (strong/range, parameterization base)
  Confirmation (OOS): 2022-01-01 ~ 2026-07-05 (includes 2022 bearish regime)
    - R-bear: 2022 (mean-reversion adversity test)
    - R-recovery: 2023
    - R-recent: 2024-end

Cross-Asset: BTC & ETH both pass independently (parameter frozen -> both confirmation tracks)

